provenance.prompt:
Create an original 1024×1024 true-transparent RGBA sprite sheet for JAMVERSE '96. Use the supplied Leo gameplay sprite only as an identity and pixel-art style reference. Draw exactly four distinct complete full-body Leo poses in a strict two-column by two-row grid, row-major, with broad transparent gutters and outer margins. All long hair, hands and shoes remain inside each cell; consistent scale and ground baseline. Readable 1990s arcade pixel-art clusters and dark outlines.

Leo is the pale aristocratic adult human captain of the Blackthorn Court Kings. Preserve pale skin, long wavy black hair, refined mustache, composed handsome face, natural adult anatomy and controlled poise. He wears his black basketball uniform with restrained crimson accents, matching shorts and shoes. Exactly two arms, two hands, two legs and two shoes. No fangs, horns, cape, robe, monster traits, extra limbs, costume change or props.

This is a right-facing defensive shot block. Leo has empty hands; the basketball is separate game art. Do not draw any ball, sphere, orb, seams, court, hoop, floor, ground shadow, background, glow, border, grid, text, teammate or opponent. Exterior and gutters must be true alpha-zero transparency with no checkerboard, matte, speckles or haze.

Four sequential poses:
0 poised defensive stance, knees bent and both empty hands ready;
1 takeoff at simulation tick2, jumps vertically with both arms rising to contest a shot;
2 apex at simulation tick5, one arm extends high to tip the off-screen ball, other hand balances, face focused;
3 descends under control, arms lower and feet return to a balanced defensive stance.

Keep Leo right-facing and recognizably pale, human, long-haired, mustached and black/crimson. Use plausible joints and a strong but controlled captain presence. Return only the transparent sprite sheet.
